[2026-09-04 17:29:57] [INFO] API Gateway RAW Response [prov_1779643665_n0pte]: {"id":"gen-1788542981-6UELimoE4anve6sGKL58","object":"chat.completion","created":1788542981,"model":"minimax/minimax-m3:free","provider":"GMICloud","system_fingerprint":null,"service_tier":null,"choices":[{"index":0,"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop","native_finish_reason":"stop","message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\"needs_manual_input\":[\"tech_specs.homepage\"],\"tech_specs\":{\"software_name\":\"ProgDVB\",\"file_name\":\"ProgDVB7.72.7x64.exe\",\"version\":\"7.72.7\",\"license\":\"Freemium\",\"developer\":\"ProgDVB Software\",\"homepage\":\"https://www.progdvb.com/\",\"changelogurl\":\"https://www.progdvb.com/\",\"file_size\":\"38.7 MB\",\"os_support\":\"Windows 7, Windows 8, Windows 8.1, Windows 10 (32-bit and 64-bit)\",\"language_support\":\"Multi-language (interface localizations available)\",\"last_updated\":\"2024\"},\"whats_new\":[\"New TV source added\",\"Updated XMLTV support (for example epg.one guide)\",\"Czech and Slovak localization update\",\"HDR support added (from version 7.70.7)\",\"Experiment with MKV/MP4 recording (from version 7.69.0)\",\"Big update of file functions including open files, open folder, command line support, drag and drop (from version 7.61.3)\",\"Screenshot function and updated menus (from version 7.61.0)\",\"DASH support and various fixes (from version 7.50.3)\"],\"system_requirements\":{\"minimum\":{\"os\":\"Windows 7, 8, 8.1, 10 (32-bit and 64-bit)\",\"processor\":\"Intel Pentium III 500 MHz for SD channels; Intel Pentium 4 4.0 GHz for HD channels\",\"ram\":\"512 MB\",\"disk_space\":\"50 MB plus space for Video & Audio Recording\",\"graphics\":\"SVGA Videocard Adapter with 32 MB onboard memory\",\"additional_software\":\"Microsoft .NET Framework 2.0 or higher (ProgDVB); .NET Framework 4.0 (ProgTV); DirectX 8.0 or higher; MPEG-2 Video DirectShow codec; H.264/AVC codec for DVB-S2 or HD channels\"},\"recommended\":{\"os\":\"Windows 10 (64-bit)\",\"processor\":\"Multi-core processor for HD channels\",\"ram\":\"2 GB or more\",\"disk_space\":\"50 MB plus space for Video & Audio Recording\"},\"_note\":\"SoundBlaster compatible sound card required. Network adapter (100 Mb) recommended for broadcasting.\"},\"tags\":[\"progdvb\",\"dvbviewer\",\"tvviewer\",\"freemium\"],\"hero_section\":{\"software_name\":\"ProgDVB Professional\",\"version\":\"7.72.7\",\"license\":\"Freemium (Standard Free, Professional Paid)\",\"file_size\":\"38.7 MB\",\"rating\":4,\"download_links\":[],\"min_os\":\"Windows 7 (32-bit)\",\"last_updated\":\"2024\"},\"introduction\":\"**ProgDVB** is a comprehensive digital television and radio software solution for Windows that lets you watch satellite, cable, and terrestrial TV channels directly on your PC. Designed to work with DVB-PCI cards, SAT-dishes, and various tuner devices, it supports an impressive range of broadcast standards including DVB-S, DVB-S2, DVB-C, DVB-T, ATSC, ISDB-T, and IPTV, with access to approximately 8,000 channels.\\n\\nWhat sets ProgDVB apart is its dual-interface approach. The **ProgDVB** interface is mouse-oriented and packed with advanced functions, while **ProgTV** serves as a remote-control-friendly companion for home theater PCs (HTPCs). Both share the same channel lists, settings, and configuration folder, giving you flexibility depending on whether you're sitting at a desk or relaxing on the couch.\\n\\nBeyond simple viewing, **ProgDVB** delivers a full suite of media features: high-definition H.264/AVC playback, picture-in-picture with simultaneous multi-channel recording, timeshifting with unlimited buffer size, a 10-band equalizer, network broadcasting, and support for VR, VMR7, VMR9, and EVR renderers. It also handles teletext, subtitles (including closed captions), and electronic program guides from Digital TV, XmlTV, or JTV sources.\\n\\nWith customizable skins, OSD support, and multi-language localizations, **ProgDVB** appeals to both casual viewers wanting free Standard access and power users willing to pay for the Professional or Network Pro editions with expanded capabilities.\",\"features\":[\"**High Definition TV support** including H.264/AVC for crystal-clear satellite and cable broadcasts\",\"**Picture-in-picture** functionality with independent simultaneous recording and playback of multiple channels from one or more devices\",\"**Broad device compatibility** supporting most DVB, ISDB-T, and ATSC hardware including DiSEqC and CAM interfaces\",\"**Comprehensive audio format support** covering MPEG, AC3, AAC, and all major digital TV audio standards\",\"**Unlimited timeshifting** using RAM or disk buffer so you never miss a moment of live TV\",\"**10-band equalizer** for fine-tuning audio output to your preferences\",\"**TV and Radio recording** to disk for later playback, plus file-based media playback\",\"**Electronic Program Guide (EPG)** support from Digital TV broadcasts, XmlTV, or JTV sources\",\"**Teletext and subtitles** including Teletext, image-based, and closed captions\",\"**Multiple renderer support** including VR, VMR7, VMR9, and EVR with OSD (except VR)\",\"**Network broadcasting** capability to stream content across your local network\",\"**Customizable skins** for both OSD and the main GUI interface\",\"**Multi-language interface localizations** to suit international users\",\"**Approximately 8,000 channels** in the default list covering satellite, cable, terrestrial, and IPTV sources\",\"**Dual interface design** with ProgDVB (mouse-focused, feature-rich) and ProgTV (remote-control-optimized for HTPC use)\",\"**HDR support** added in recent versions for enhanced visual quality\"],\"moat_data\":{\"quick_start_recipes\":[{\"title\":\"Setting Up Your First DVB Device\",\"description\":\"Launch ProgDVB and navigate to Settings > Device Manager. Select your DVB card from the detected hardware list. Configure the tuner type (DVB-S/S2, DVB-C, DVB-T, ATSC, or ISDB-T) based on your broadcast source. Set the LNB frequency if using satellite, or input your cable provider details for DVB-C connections. Click 'Apply' and then run a channel scan to populate your channel list.\"},{\"title\":\"Configuring XMLTV EPG Guide\",\"description\":\"Open Settings > EPG and select 'XmlTV' as your guide source. Download or subscribe to an XMLTV provider such as epg.one. Point ProgDVB to your XMLTV file location and set the update interval. Map the XMLTV channel IDs to your ProgDVB channels using the Channel Editor. The guide will now populate automatically with program schedules.\"},{\"title\":\"Recording and Timeshifting Setup\",\"description\":\"Allocate a dedicated storage folder for recordings via Settings > Recording. Enable timeshifting and configure your buffer size (unlimited disk or RAM-based). To record, press the record button or set scheduled recordings in the EPG. Recordings can be saved in MKV or MP4 format. Enable picture-in-picture to watch one channel while browsing or recording another.\"}]},\"competitors\":[\"DVBViewer\",\"NextPVR\",\"Kodi (with TVHeadend backend)\",\"MediaPortal\",\"TVCenter\",\"EyeTV (macOS)\"],\"faqs\":[],\"pros_cons\":{\"pros\":[\"Supports an extensive range of DVB standards and devices\",\"Dual interface caters to both desktop and HTPC use cases\",\"Unlimited timeshift buffer size\",\"Free Standard edition available with core functionality\",\"Large pre-loaded channel list (~8,000 channels)\",\"Robust multi-channel recording capabilities\"],\"cons\":[\"Professional and Network Pro editions require payment\",\"Interface can feel dated compared to modern media players\",\"No native macOS or Linux support\",\"Requires additional codecs for HD viewing\",\"Older minimum hardware requirements may not reflect modern system needs\"]},\"installation_guide\":\"1. Download the appropriate ProgDVB installer (Standard Free, Professional, or Network Pro) for your Windows architecture (32-bit or 64-bit) from the official ProgDVB website.\\n2. Ensure Microsoft .NET Framework 2.0 or higher is installed (ProgTV additionally requires .NET Framework 4.0).\\n3. Install DirectX 8.0 or higher and an MPEG-2 Video DirectShow codec (the ProgDVB installer includes the Elecard shareware codec).\\n4. Install an H.264/AVC codec if you plan to watch DVB-S2 or HD channels.\\n5. Run the downloaded executable and follow the on-screen installation wizard.\\n6. Launch ProgDVB and configure your DVB device through Settings > Device Manager.\\n7. Perform a channel scan to populate your channel list and start watching digital TV.\",\"changelog_summary\":\"Version 7.72.7 introduces a new TV source, updates XMLTV support (including epg.one guide compatibility), and refreshes Czech and Slovak localizations. Recent versions have also added HDR support, experimental MKV/MP4 recording, expanded file playback functions, a screenshot tool, redesigned radio and options layouts, and DASH streaming support.\"}","refusal":null,"reasoning":null}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":5094,"completion_tokens":1906,"total_tokens":7000,"cost":0,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":5093,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}
