ing\":4,\"download_links\":[],\"min_os\":\"Windows 7\",\"last_updated\":\"July 2025\"},\"meta_description\":\"Download ProgDVB 7.72.7 – a free universal DVB software for watching digital satellite, cable, terrestrial, ATSC, ISDB-T and IPTV TV channels. Supports HD H.264/AVC, recording, timeshift and EPG.\",\"focus_keyword\":\"ProgDVB download\",\"introduction\":\"**ProgDVB** stands as one of the most established and versatile digital television applications available on the Windows platform, letting users watch satellite, cable, and terrestrial broadcasts straight from a PC. The newest release, **ProgDVB 7.72.7**, continues the program's long tradition of supporting an enormous range of DVB hardware and signal formats while refining the underlying playback engine. With built-in handling of DVB-S, DVB-S2, DVB-C, DVB-T, ATSC, ISDB-T, and IPTV sources, the application ships with a channel database of roughly 8000 entries, making setup quick for newcomers while leaving plenty of room for enthusiasts to dig deeper.\\n\\nThe package actually bundles two front ends that share a single channel list and configuration folder. **ProgDVB** is the mouse-driven desktop client with the broadest set of features, while **ProgTV** is its companion interface designed for HTPC use with a remote control. Together they cover everyday viewing, picture-in-picture multitasking, network broadcasting, and full recording of TV and radio streams in multiple digital media formats.\",\"features\":[\"High Definition TV support including **H.264/AVC** decoding for modern satellite and terrestrial broadcasts.\",\"Picture-in-picture mode with independent simultaneous recording and playback of several channels from one or more devices.\",\"Broad hardware compatibility covering the majority of DVB, ISDB-T and ATSC devices, including DiSEqC and CAM interfaces.\",\"Support for all major digital TV audio formats such as MPEG, AC3, and AAC.\",\"Unlimited time shifting using RAM or disk buffer, so live TV can be paused and rewound without restrictions.\",\"10-band equalizer for fine-grained audio tuning while watching or recording.\",\"Recording of TV and radio channels to disk alongside playback of local media files.\",\"Electronic Program Guide pulled from Digital TV streams or imported from XmlTV and JTV sources.\",\"Teletext and subtitles, including teletext, image-based and closed captions.\",\"Rendering support for VR, VMR7, VMR9 and EVR with on-screen display independent of channel type or signal presence.\",\"Network broadcasting to stream channels across a local network.\",\"Customizable skins for the OSD and main GUI, plus multiple interface language localizations.\"],\"pros_cons\":{\"pros\":[\"Supports virtually every DVB standard: DVB-S/S2, DVB-C, DVB-T, ATSC, ISDB-T and IPTV.\",\"Huge pre-loaded channel database with around 8000 entries out of the box.\",\"Dual interface: ProgDVB for mouse users and ProgTV for HTPC remote control setups.\",\"Free Standard edition provides solid functionality without any cost.\",\"Picture-in-picture plus multi-channel recording from a single device.\",\"Wide codec and renderer support including H.264/AVC HD playback.\"],\"cons\":[\"Requires additional codecs for HD and DVB-S2 channels; the bundled MPEG-2 codec is shareware.\",\"Older Intel Pentium III-era hardware specs limit smooth HD playback on legacy systems.\",\"Separate Professional and Network Pro editions mean advanced features are paid.\",\"Installation and channel scanning can feel intimidating for first-time DVB users.\",\"Windows-only application with no native macOS or Linux builds.\"]},\"faqs\":[],\"moat_data\":{},\"competitors\":[{\"name\":\"DVBViewer\",\"reason\":\"Long-standing commercial DVB application with strong plugin ecosystem.\"},{\"name\":\"NextPVR\",\"reason\":\"Free, open-source DVR and live TV viewer for Windows with broad hardware support.\"},{\"name\":\"TVHeadend\",\"reason\":\"Popular open-source TV streaming server, typically paired with Kodi as the front end.\"},{\"name\":\"Kodi with PVR clients\",\"reason\":\"Open-source media center with add-ons for DVB-S/S2, DVB-C, DVB-T and IPTV.\"}],\"installation_guide\":\"1. Download the appropriate ProgDVB 7.72.7 installer for your architecture from the official download section above (Standard Free, Professional, or Network Pro, 32-bit or 64-bit).\\n2. Make sure **Microsoft .NET Framework 2.0 or higher** is installed; install **.NET 4.0** if you also plan to use ProgTV.\\n3. Install **DirectX 8.0 or higher** and ensure an MPEG-2 DirectShow codec is present. The ProgDVB installer includes the Elecard shareware codec for MPEG-2.\\n4. For DVB-S2 or HD channels, install a separate **H.264/AVC** codec on your system.\\n5. Run the downloaded installer (e.g. ProgDVB7.72.7x64.exe) and follow the on-screen prompts to complete setup.\\n6. Launch ProgDVB, run a channel scan for your DVB device or IPTV playlist, and start watching live TV.\",\"download_section\":{\"download_links\":[]},\"taxonomy\":[\"windows\",\"video\",\"freeware\",\"dvb-viewer\"]}","refusal":null,"reasoning":null}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":5094,"completion_tokens":1509,"total_tokens":6603,"cost":0,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":5093,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}
