B \u2013 the universal and very power software for watching digital TV and listening to radio channels! It allows you to watch SAT-Television and listen to Radio channels directly from satellite by using DVB-PCI cards with hardware decoders on the board, SAT-dish, and personal computers with Microsoft Windows installed.\nProgDVB and ProgTV is two is 2 independent user interfaces which can work together from one folder at one list of channels, settings etc.\nProgTV is aimed at use with remote control (HTPC). ProgDVB contains more functions but is intended for use by a mouse.\nProgDVB has options for working with network broadcasting and Audio\/Video recording of the stream to different digital-media formats. About 8000 channels in the list; DVB-S (satellite), DVB-S2, DVB-C (cable), DVB-T, ATSC, ISDB-T, IPTV. Analog TV or playback from a file.\nProgDVB Main functions:\n\nHigh Definition TV support including H.264\/AVC\nPicture-in-picture support as well as independent simultaneous recording\/playback of several channels from one or more devices\nSupport for the majority of DVB, ISDB-T and ATSC devices including DiSEqC and CAM interfaces support\nSupport for all digital TV audio formats: MPEG, AC3, AAC,\u2026\nTime shifting functionality using the RAM or disk buffer of unlimited size\n10 Bands equalizer\nTV and Radio channels recording\nPlayback from disk based files\nElectronic program guide (EPG) from Digital TV or XmlTV, JTV.\nTeletext\nSubtile (Teletext, image-based and closed captions)\nSupport for VR, VMR7, VMR9 and EVR renderers including OSD (except VR) independently from channel type or signal presence\nNetwork broadcasting\nSkins for OSD and GUI\nInterface Language Localizations\n\n                \n\n                &lt;h3&gt;Changes in version 7.71.0:&lt;\/h3&gt;\n\n\n\nNew TV source.\nUpdate xmltv support (for example epg.one guide)\nCzech and Slovak update.\n\n\nChanges in version 7.70.7:\n\n\nHDR support.\n\n\nChanges in version 7.69.0:\n\n\nExperiment with mkv\/mp4 recording\n\n\nChanges in version 7.61.3:\n\n\nBig update of file functions.\nOpen files, Open folder, from command line, drag and drop, \u2026\nUpdate of file playback, record clips, VOD films downloads, ..\n\n\nChanges in version 7.61.0:\n\n\nNew layout of radio and options.\nScreenshot function.\nUpdate menus.\n\n\nChanges in version 7.52.6:\n\n\nImportant fixes of timeshift, refresh of channel function,\u2026\n\n\nChanges in version 7.50.3:\n\n\nDASH support. fixes.\n\n\nChanges in version 7.49.5:\n\n\nUpdate scale function of GUI skin. \u201cNo skin\u201d interface must working with any font sizes.\n\n\n            &lt;\/div&gt;\n\n                Homepage \u2013 &lt;a href=\"https:\/\/www.progdvb.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"&gt;https:\/\/progdvb.com&lt;\/a&gt;\n\n\nSupported Operating Systems: Windows 7. 8, 8.1, 10 (32-bit and 64-bit)\n\n\n\nSoftware which you will need installed before using ProgDVB:\n\n\nProgDVB requires Microsoft .NET Framework Version 2.0 or higher\nProgTV requires full Microsoft .NET Framework Version 4.0\nDirectX v.8.0 or higher.\nMPEG-2 Video DirectShow codec (ProgDVB installer includes the Elecard shareware codec)\nH.264\/AVC codec if you want to watch DVB-S2 or HD channels.\n\n\nMinimum hardware requirements:\n\n\nIntel Pentium III Processor 500 MHz or better for SD channels.\nIntel Pentium 4 Processor 4.0 GHz or better for HD channels.\n512 MB memory on board.\n50 MB of disk space (plus the space required for Video&amp;Audio Recording).\nSVGA Videocard Adapter with 32 MB onboard memory.\nSoundBlaster compatible sound card.\nNetwork adapter (100 Mb) for broadcasting\n\n\n            &lt;\/div&gt;\n\n                Size: 38.7 MB\n\n\nDOWNLOAD Standard for Windows 32-bit FREE\n\nDOWNLOAD Standard for Windows 64-bit FREE\n\nDOWNLOAD Professional for Windows 32-bit\n\nDOWNLOAD Professional for Windows 64-bit\n\nDOWNLOAD Network Pro for Windows 32-bit\n\nDOWNLOAD Network Pro for Windows 64-bit\n\nRequir