d system information display from a separate window to the main window.\n    Prevented installation webpage from opening during driver restoration when DPInst files already exist.\n    Prevented the program update window from appearing when restarting after resizing.\n    Saved language selection.\n    Saved System Information refresh interval.\n    Saved System Information window size.\n    Updated System Information refresh to refresh only items that require updating.\n    Updated title bar of the language selection window with multilingual support.\n    Updated program execution to request administrator privileges only when required instead of always running as administrator.\n    Updated the Update History and Screenshot buttons with highlighting.\n\n\nNewly added product or support has been enhanced\n\n\n    Realtek HD Audio (ALC222)\n    Realtek HD Audio (ALC236)\n    Realtek HD Audio (ALC245)\n    Realtek HD Audio (ALC257)\n    Realtek HD Audio (ALC274)\n    Realtek HD Audio (ALC285)\n    Realtek HD Audio (ALC287)\n    Realtek HD Audio (ALC293)\n    Realtek HD Audio (ALC294)\n    Realtek HD Audio (ALC295)\n    Realtek HD Audio (ALC886)\n    Realtek HD Audio (ALC887)\n    Realtek HD Audio (ALC1220)\n\n\nDownload: 3DP Chip 26.08 | 7.3 MB (Freeware)\nLinks: 3DP Chip Home Page | Screenshot\n\nSOURCE_URL: unknown\n\nPHP_DETECTED_METADATA (Weak Hints):\n{\"software_name\":\"3DP Chip\",\"version\":\"26.08\",\"homepage\":\"https:\\\/\\\/www.3dpchip.com\\\/3dpchip\\\/sub\\\/chip_eng.html\",\"category\":\"\",\"is_existing_article\":true,\"detected_version\":\"26.08\",\"detected_file_size\":\"7.3 MB\",\"resolved_links\":[{\"url\":\"https:\\\/\\\/www.3dpchip.com\\\/new\\\/3DP_Chip_v2608.exe\",\"text\":\"3DP Chip 26.08\",\"platform\":\"\",\"variant\":\"Standard\",\"link_type\":\"direct\"}],\"detected_links\":[{\"url\":\"https:\\\/\\\/www.3dpchip.com\\\/new\\\/3DP_Chip_v2608.exe\",\"text\":\"3DP Chip 26.08\",\"platform\":\"\",\"variant\":\"Standard\",\"link_type\":\"direct