VK/VKD3D translation for DirectX 9–12.\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"name\": \"Optional Microsoft DLL Support\",\n            \"description\": \"Can load genuine Windows DLLs (via winetricks or manual placement) when built-in implementations fall short, improving compatibility for stubborn proprietary software.\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"name\": \"Winelib Development Toolkit\",\n            \"description\": \"Lets developers recompile Windows source code against Wine's headers to produce native Unix binaries, easing porting efforts for legacy codebases.\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"name\": \"Multi-Architecture Support\",\n            \"description\": \"Runs on x86_64, ARM64, and (with WoW64) 32-bit Windows apps on 64-bit hosts, covering everything from Raspberry Pi to high-end workstations.\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"name\": \"Active Community & Regression Testing\",\n            \"description\": \"Hundreds of contributors and the Wine Application Database (AppDB) provide crowd-sourced compatibility reports, workarounds, and regression tracking for each release.\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"tech_specs\": {\n        \"software_name\": \"Wine\",\n        \"file_name\": \"wine-11.17.tar.xz\",\n        \"version\": \"11.17 Beta\",\n        \"license\": \"LGPL-2.1-or-later\",\n        \"developer\": \"The Wine Project / WineHQ\",\n        \"homepage\": \"https://www.winehq.org/\",\n        \"changelogurl\": \"https://www.winehq.org/announce/11.17\",\n        \"file_size\": \"44.6 MB\",\n        \"os_support\": \"Linux (all major distros), macOS 10.13+, FreeBSD, NetBSD, OpenBSD, Solaris\",\n        \"language_support\": \"English (UI), supports applications in any language\",\n        \"last_updated\": \"June 2025\"\n    },\n    \"system_requirements\": {\n        \"minimum\": {\n            \"os\": \"Linux kernel 3.10+ / macOS 10.13+ / FreeBSD 12+\",\n            \"processor\": \"x86_64 or ARM64 CPU\",\n            \"ram\": \